# 段2（expl-p2-v0.3）の出力の形の縛り（指示書76 §1-3）。プロンプトの「# 出力」の形を、そのまま文法にしたもの。
# 型と項目の並びだけを縛る。文の中身は縛らない（確かめが見る）。始まり（root）は候補ごとに足す。
body ::= "{" ws "\"meanings\"" ws ":" ws "[" ws ( meaning ( ws "," ws meaning )* )? ws "]" ws "}"
meaning ::= "{" ws "\"purpose_ref\"" ws ":" ws string ws "," ws "\"text\"" ws ":" ws string ws "," ws "\"cites\"" ws ":" ws "[" ws ( integer ( ws "," ws integer )* )? ws "]" ws "}"
integer ::= "0" | [1-9] [0-9]{0,3}
string ::= "\"" char* "\""
char ::= [^"\\\x7F\x00-\x1F] | "\\" ( ["\\/bfnrt] | "u" [0-9a-fA-F]{4} )
ws ::= | " " | "\n" [ \t]{0,20}
